sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Create a lesson from your own video
    accDescr: Consent, idempotent request, GPU runner stages, fenced publication, polling and verified download into the lesson player.
    autonumber
    actor P as Player
    participant App as iOS app
    participant API as FootyLevels API
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant R as GPU runner
    participant G as Gemini API
    participant C as Adapter and model runtime
    participant SB as Supabase
    P->>App: Tap Create lesson on a ready video
    App->>API: GET /api/me
    opt First time on this account
        App->>P: Consent sheet, the video is sent to Google for AI analysis
        P->>App: Allow
        App->>API: PUT /api/me/consents/lesson-ai
    end
    App->>API: POST /api/projects/id/lessons with inputRevision and Idempotency-Key
    API->>FS: One transaction: consent, ready video, max 20 s, no active job, daily limit 3, intake open
    API-->>App: 202, Location /api/jobs/id
    R->>FS: Claim buildLesson job
    R->>SB: Download prepared video
    R->>G: Screen the whole clip
    alt Nothing to teach
        R->>FS: Fail with lesson_rejected, no GPU time spent
    else Moves found
        R->>C: Whole-clip 3D motion with ball tracking, then measurements
        C-->>R: analysis.json, mesh, motion, tracking boxes
        R->>G: Look at each move close up, Teach, Verify each claim
        R->>R: Deterministic checks, build bundle, app contract check
        R->>SB: Upload bundle files after reserving bytes
        R->>FS: Publish lesson, job succeeded, project latestLessonId
    end
    loop Every 15 s while active
        App->>API: GET /api/jobs/id
    end
    App->>API: GET /api/lessons/id, POST /api/lessons/id/assets
    App->>SB: Download every file, check SHA-256 and size
    App->>P: Lesson opens, labelled AI-generated, with Report a problem
